# Screenshots Directory

Place your app screenshots here for the README.

## Recommended Screenshots:
1. home_screen.png - Main home screen with notes grid
2. note_editor.png - Note creation/editing screen
3. drawing_page.png - Handwriting/drawing feature
4. ai_chat.png - AI chat interface
5. security_setup.png - Passphrase/security screen
6. cloud_sync.png - Cloud synchronization feature

## Recommended Dimensions:
- Width: 1080px (or your device width)
- Format: PNG or WebP
- Aspect Ratio: Mobile portrait (9:16 or similar)

## Tips:
- Use consistent device frame or no frame at all
- Enable dark mode for consistency with app theme
- Hide status bar details if possible
- Capture actual usage scenarios
